PART 1: PARAMETER COUNTS OF ACTUAL MODELS
------------------------------------------------------------

  Model                    Total        Attn   Attn%       QAttn       Saved   New Total  Reduction
  ──────────────────  ──────────  ──────────  ──────  ──────────  ──────────  ──────────  ─────────
  GPT-2 Small               124M         28M    23%          7M         21M        103M       17%
  GPT-2 Medium              355M        101M    28%         25M         75M        280M       21%
  GPT-2 Large               774M        236M    30%         59M        177M        597M       23%
  LLaMA-7B                  6.7B        2.1B    32%        537M        1.6B        5.1B       24%
  LLaMA-13B                13.0B        4.2B    32%        1.0B        3.1B        9.9B       24%
